{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The free Bellona DLC is the LEGEND BATTLES continent that is attached to the Aurora Island that comes with the app. Bellona is simply gigantic with specifications never before achieved for a Battle Royale app. Bellona is 400 km2 of rocky mountain deserts dotted with hundreds of megacities with very different architectural styles for each megacity, extreme urban density, all of whose thousands of buildings are accessible with very different interiors and rich in furniture, whose roofs are accessible and equipped for combat, and rather cyberpunk basements and undergrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/db8c67a28b6084189dae1cf7db1daf63.poster.avif?t=1752659592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/db8c67a28b6084189dae1cf7db1daf63.webm?t=1752659592\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ziplines are everywhere in Bellona and Aurora, and they're fast. A classic strategy is to jump along the way to reach inaccessible infrastructure to better surprise your opponents. With LEGEND BATTLES ziplines, you can climb impressive heights in the blink of an eye or quickly escape a dangerous situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/0043a49346aaccf03cb765ed85feb454.poster.avif?t=1752659592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/0043a49346aaccf03cb765ed85feb454.webm?t=1752659592\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LEGEND BATTLES vehicles are incredibly stable, and the racing cars reach an amazing speed of 406 km/h (252 mph), which is completely unprecedented for a shooting game. At such speeds, even the most skilled snipers will have great difficulty in damaging you. With the dense urban areas of Bellona and Aurora, driving these marvelous super cars at high speed is an exhilarating spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/3018f61f2277f862fb42045b044a23ba.poster.avif?t=1752659592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/3018f61f2277f862fb42045b044a23ba.webm?t=1752659592\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As seen in this GIF shot directly from the app without any special processing (like all the GIFs), the fights become much more complicated when these megacities offer several levels, interiors, basements, roofs equiped for combat and a high density of buildings, vehicles, urban furniture and vegetation. The LEGEND BATTLES development team has made it a point of honor to break the classic barriers of battle royale games and Epic Games has helped us a lot with this fantastic version of Unreal Engine 5.6.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/ca0cf210a5728564dd31f394ed38065d.poster.avif?t=1752659592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/ca0cf210a5728564dd31f394ed38065d.webm?t=1752659592\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Helicopters are wonderful vehicles for moving quickly, avoiding urban infrastructure, admiring the splendid landscape that's well worth many selfies, and also for taking down your opponents from high above while sitting partially outside the helicopter, which provides a thrill, especially when the helicopter changes course abruptly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/22488b9c6f150325dad4c8124986121f.poster.avif?t=1752659592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/22488b9c6f150325dad4c8124986121f.webm?t=1752659592\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deserts are dotted with all sorts of environments, including these Alien forests with extraterrestrial vegetation that sometimes glows in the dark and is populated by flora of sizes beyond imagination. The vegetation in each of these numerous forests is completely different, offering a constant exploration of the wonders of LEGEND BATTLES. And since the vehicles are so stable, you'll be able to drive almost anywhere within these countless splendors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/4b61666c8a2588a1b516a1bd89cb4423.poster.avif?t=1752659592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/4b61666c8a2588a1b516a1bd89cb4423.webm?t=1752659592\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Motorcycles reach remarkable speeds, and racing bikes boast unique performance, reaching speeds of 395 km/h (245 mph), which is unheard of in a battle royale game. These bikes can go anywhere, jump everywhere, and land on their two wheels. But be careful, because all LEGEND BATTLES vehicles are partially destructible and have a certain level of health, much like avatar health. To top it all off, vehicles consume fuel, so you have to refuel according to the fuel gauge level to avoid continuing on foot, which could be dangerous, even fatal, depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/bdc65712fa421cee16b5f825c3dda450.poster.avif?t=1752659592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/bdc65712fa421cee16b5f825c3dda450.webm?t=1752659592\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LEGEND BATTLES alternates between Egyptian pyramids, Greek temples, Roman temples, Hindu temples, Inca temples, extraterrestrial temples, but also cathedrals, churches, mosques, and synagogues with sumptuous and grandiose interiors that grandly depict the wonders of the era. The environments can also become more disturbing, like the immense, somewhat unsanitary, cave leading to the giant resurrection station, and the numerous underground passages and basements with gloomy lighting that haunt the lands of Bellona and Aurora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/2d3df28d8520204904355e48b3b770f6.poster.avif?t=1752659592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/extras/2d3df28d8520204904355e48b3b770f6.webm?t=1752659592\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your motorcycle will roar across the vast expanses of snow and ice in LEGEND BATTLES. In this GIF, the rider leaps over obstacles in the air to land on his two wheels and engage in a frantic race across this icy lake within the sci-fi space base. Note that this machine's stability is guaranteed, provided you know how to handle this sport bike well. This Battle Royale also offers uniformly colored skins, and in this case, white for the clothing, motorcycle, and weapons would be ideal camouflage for this Nordic environment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874560?t=1752659592","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/a74b928609d656b2d60d427272dd888fff5f3cd1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752659592","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/65e44944d14f5b53788e6b2bbd2466ff9b84cfc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752659592","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874560/65e44944d14f5b53788e6b2bbd2466ff9b84cfc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752659592","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The free Bellona DLC is the LEGEND BATTLES continent that is attached to the Aurora Island that comes with the app. Bellona is simply gigantic with specifications never before achieved for a Battle Royale app. Bellona is 400 km2 of rocky mountain deserts dotted with hundreds of megacities with very different architectural styles for each megacity, extreme urban density, all of whose thousands of buildings are accessible with very different interiors and rich in furniture, whose roofs are accessible and equipped for combat, and rather cyberpunk basements and undergrounds.</p><p clas